# Line endings.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows and built on Linux. Without an
# explicit rule, behaviour depends on each machine's core.autocrlf, and copying
# a Windows working tree into WSL produces spurious diffs that look like real
# changes. Normalise to LF everywhere: in the repository, and in the working
# tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Licence texts are reproduced verbatim from SPDX. Do not let anything rewrite
# their line endings -- they are byte-sensitive in a legal sense.
LICENSES/*.txt -text

# Build artefacts and binaries.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.qcow2 binary
*.iso  binary
*.raw.xz binary